# (0.15) KTEST on the text shell (NODESK): the kernel additions of 0.15 (user/ktest.s).
# tests/mousegen.py makes tests/ktest.keys from this. Its console must match
# tests/ktest.txt, and the sound writes (emu816 --log-sound) tests/ktest.err.
1500 {esc}
3000 ktest\n
# parts 1-4 (joystick, vsync, chimes, sound owners) end at about 6.5 s; then window A
# a (held) and o (held): o opens window B; A gets both releases, then WE_UNFOCUS; B gets
# WE_FOCUS; the real releases reach nobody
8000 {d04}
8300 {d12}
8800 {u12}
9000 {u04}
# b to B; c (held) closes B: A gets WE_FOCUS
9400 b
9800 {d06}
10100 {u06}
# A's menu (its title at the left of the bar): "Second" (WE_MENU 0, 1)
10600 M -100:-100:0:0
10650 M -100:-72:0:0
10700 M -100:0:0:0
10750 M 0:0:0:1
10830 M 0:0:0:0
11100 M 10:30:0:0
11200 M 0:0:0:1
11280 M 0:0:0:0
# the pointer over A: motion with no button held: c = 0000 (no phantom bit after a menu)
11800 M 100:100:0:0
11850 M 70:22:0:0
# a right press in A: the pop-up menu below and right of the pointer; dragged to "Two",
# released there: popup 0001
12500 M 0:0:0:2
12600 M 20:23:0:2
13000 M 0:0:0:0
# a right click: the menu stays open; Esc: popup ffff
13600 M 0:0:0:2
13680 M 0:0:0:0
14100 {esc}
# the menu key: the menu at 10, 10 of A, its first item highlighted; Down, Enter: 0001
14800 {d65}
14900 {u65}
15400 {down}
15700 \n
16500 q
